title: "[Beslisboom] AddMediatRPattern.Rewrite" {shape: text; near: top-center; style: {font-size: 24; bold: true}}
direction: down
q1: "x.AddMediatR(lambda met\néén parameter)?" {shape: diamond}
q2: "Body: expressie of blok met\nalleen expressie-statements?" {shape: diamond}
q3: "Per instelling:\nRegisterServicesFrom*?" {shape: diamond}
q4: "Behavior-aanroep met\nalleen typeof / generics?" {shape: diamond}
q5: "cfg.Lifetime =\nServiceLifetime.X?" {shape: diamond}
q6: "Expression body\nmet behaviors?" {shape: diamond}
m1: "Manual: not called as AddMediatR(cfg => ...)\n(no-lambda)"
m2: "Manual: not a list of cfg calls\n(geen proof)"
m3: "Manual: cfg.X(...) has no direct equivalent\n(unknown-call, behavior-lifetime)"
m4: "Manual: 'instelling' has no direct equivalent\n(publisher)"
m5: "Manual: behaviors in expression lambda\n(geen proof)"
d: "vervalt (source generator)"
b: "PipelineBehaviors += typeof(...)"
l: "ServiceLifetime = ServiceLifetime.X\n(standaard Transient)"
f: "AddMediator(cfg => ...)\n(behaviors, expression)"
